ty"]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Semgrep Finding: skills.preprocessing-injection.skill-preprocessing-credential-access.skill-preprocessing-credential-access"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Preprocessing command combining encoding with network transmission. This pattern (encode | network) is commonly used for data exfiltration, executing before Claude processes the skill."},"help":{"markdown":"Preprocessing command combining encoding with network transmission. This pattern (encode | network) is commonly used for data exfiltration, executing before Claude processes the skill.\n\n<b>References:</b>\n - [Semgrep Rule](https://semgrep.dev/r/skills.preprocessing-injection.skill-preprocessing-encoding-network.skill-preprocessing-encoding-network)\n - [https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills#inject-dynamic-context](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills#inject-dynamic-context)\n","text":"Preprocessing command combining encoding with network transmission. This pattern (encode | network) is commonly used for data exfiltration, executing before Claude processes the skill."},"helpUri":"https://semgrep.dev/r/skills.preprocessing-injection.skill-preprocessing-encoding-network.skill-preprocessing-encoding-network","id":"skills.preprocessing-injection.skill-preprocessing-encoding-network.skill-preprocessing-encoding-network","name":"skills.preprocessing-injection.skill-preprocessing-encoding-network.skill-preprocessing-encoding-network","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":["CWE-506: Embedded Malicious Code","HIGH CONFIDENCE","security"]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Semgrep Finding: skills.preprocessing-injection.skill-preprocessing-encoding-network.skill-preprocessing-encoding-network"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Preprocessing command performing a full environment variable dump to a\nnetwork destination. Unlike targeted credential harvesting (env | grep KEY),\nthis dumps ALL environment variables to an attacker-controlled endpoint,\ncapturing every secret in the process environment before Claude sees the\nskill content.\n\nPreprocessing commands (!`...`) execute before skill content is processed\nand can bypass Claude's approval prompts.\n\nIMPACT: Full runtime secret exfiltration before any user interaction\n"},"help":{"markdown":"Preprocessing command performing a full environment variable dump to a\nnetwork destination. Unlike targeted credential harvesting (env | grep KEY),\nthis dumps ALL environment variables to an attacker-controlled endpoint,\ncapturing every secret in the process environment before Claude sees the\nskill content.\n\nPreprocessing commands (!`...`) execute before skill content is processed\nand can bypass Claude's approval prompts.\n\nIMPACT: Full runtime secret exfiltration before any user interaction\n\n\n<b>References:</b>\n - [Semgrep Rule](https://semgrep.dev/r/skills.preprocessing-injection.skill-preprocessing-env-dump.skill-preprocessing-env-dump)\n - [https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1552/](https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1552/)\n - [https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills#inject-dynamic-context](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills#inject-dynamic-context)\n - [https://owasp.org/Top10/2025/A01_2025-Broken_Access_Control/](https://owasp.org/Top10/2025/A01_2025-Broken_Access_Control/)\n - [https://owasp.org/Top10/A01_2021-Broken_Access_Control](https://owasp.org/Top10/A01_2021-Broken_Access_Control)\n","text":"Preprocessing command performing a full environment variable dump to a\nnetwork destination. Unlike targeted credential harvesting (env | grep KEY),\nthis dumps ALL environment variables to an attacker-controlled endpoint,\ncapturing every secret in the process environment before Claude sees the\nskill content.\n\nPreprocessing commands (!`...`) execute before skill content is processed\nand can bypass Claude's approval prompts.\n\nIMPACT: Full runtime secret exfiltration before any user interaction\n"},"h